WEBVTT

00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:35.444
apart from this immediacy,
negative, this concreteness --

00:07:35.468 --> 00:07:38.069
now you have a sense of agency.

00:07:39.004 --> 00:07:41.474
You were responsible for your decision.

00:07:41.974 --> 00:07:43.426
So what do you do?

00:07:43.450 --> 00:07:45.954
You focus on the foregone option.

00:07:46.327 --> 00:07:47.979
You say, you know what?

00:07:48.003 --> 00:07:49.795
I should have chosen the other tea.

00:07:49.819 --> 00:07:52.605
(Laughter)

00:07:53.422 --> 00:07:56.180
That casts your decision in doubt,

00:07:56.204 --> 00:07:58.506
reduces the confidence
you have in the decision,

00:07:58.530 --> 00:08:00.886
the confidence you have
in the performance,